          "text": "<p data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"3005\">What is the output of the following code?</p><pre data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3243\" data-rawcode=\"#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;  int solve(int n) {   static int x = 1;    if (n == 0)     return x;    x = x + n;    return solve(n - 1); }  int main() {   printf(&quot;%d &quot;, solve(3));   printf(&quot;%d&quot;, solve(2));    return 0; }\" data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"\" data-linenums=\"true\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n\nint solve(int n) {\n  static int x = 1;\n\n  if (n == 0)\n    return x;\n\n  x = x + n;\n\n  return solve(n - 1);\n}\n\nint main() {\n  printf(\"%d \", solve(3));\n  printf(\"%d\", solve(2));\n\n  return 0;\n}</pre><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3328\">$\\texttt{7\\ 10}$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3328\">$\\texttt{7\\ 7}$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3328\">$\\texttt{6\\ 9}$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3328\">$\\texttt{10\\ 7}$</li></ol>",
