          "text": "<p data-start=\"4297\" data-end=\"4354\">What is the output of the following code?</p><pre data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4681\" data-rawcode=\"#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;  int main() {     int i, j, sum = 0;      for (i = 1; i &lt;= 4; i++) {         for (j = 1; j &lt;= 5; j++) {             if (j % i == 0)                 continue;              if (i + j &gt; 6)                 break;              sum = sum + i + j;         }     }      printf(&quot;%d&quot;, sum);      return 0; }\" data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"\" data-linenums=\"true\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n\nint main() {\n    int i, j, sum = 0;\n\n    for (i = 1; i &lt;= 4; i++) {\n        for (j = 1; j &lt;= 5; j++) {\n            if (j % i == 0)\n                continue;\n\n            if (i + j &gt; 6)\n                break;\n\n            sum = sum + i + j;\n        }\n    }\n\n    printf(\"%d\", sum);\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>",
